cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Tangut stroke dataset
message: If you use these strokes, cite the dataset and the character data it is measured against.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
year: 2026
authors:
  - name: Tangut Input contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/mkpoli/tangut-input
url: https://tangut.mkpo.li/dataset/
abstract: >-
  Strokes drawn with a mouse, a trackpad or a stylus on a browser pad, each kept with the Tangut
  character it was made for. Collected to train and test character recognition for a search box.
keywords:
  - Tangut
  - handwriting
  - stroke recognition
  - low-resource
  - dataset
preferred-citation:
  type: dataset
  title: Tangut stroke dataset
  authors:
    - name: Tangut Input contributors
  year: 2026
  url: https://tangut.mkpo.li/dataset/
  license: CC-BY-4.0
